          "answer": "SpaceBook-authored answer based on this unit (the textbook prints no answers):\nScience is the study of the world through observation and experiment. It works by the scientific method: a problem is recognized, observations are made, a hypothesis is formed, deductions are drawn, experiments test them, and conclusions are reported.",
