            "text": "Deforestation is one of the major cause of the loss of biodiversity. Forests are our vital resource. They are the natural factories for the production of oxygen. Forests provide habitats to wildlife. They are also the source of fuel, timber and also provide recreation to man. Forests control floods, prevent formation of deserts and keep the air clean. Some of the major reasons for deforestation are:",
