            "text": "Dr. Izhar Ahmad has received his Ph.D degree in the field of Molecular Plant Physiology from the University of York, UK. He has been teaching in Islamia College Peshawar for the last 18 years. He is also supervising MPhil and PhD research scholars. He has 30 research publications in peer review journals and he has attended various international conferences. He is co-author of several textbooks.",
